# data-simulator

- Separate OS process that appends Stage 6 JSONL ticks via `gridpulse` core.
- Own venv; editable dep on `../packages/gridpulse`. Do not embed the API or UI here.
- Shared coupling is only the events file path (`events.jsonl` / `GRIDPULSE_EVENTS_PATH`).
- Prefer running from repo root so the path matches web-server.
